# "Its controller" is the permanent's controller as it was exiled (CR 608.2h), not its owner: Bot1 steals Bot2's Ornithopter
# with Act of Treason (Mox Ruby, Mox Jet, Mox Pearl), then exiles it with Zuko's Exile (Mox Emerald, Mox Sapphire and Black
# Lotus's three red). Bot1, the controller, creates the Clue; Bot2, the owner, does not.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Black Lotus
Act of Treason
Zuko's Exile
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x20

